==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
This stage might seem difficult at first, but it isn't. The [[Maawth]] shouldn't be a problem at this point if you have the proper meatshields and crowd control. Against the three LeMurrs, proper meatshielding is necessary along with a damage dealer such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Salon Cat]] or [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]]. After you kill the boss and LeMurrs, you can easily win.

==='''Chapter 2'''===
Chapter 2 plays identical to Chapter 1 only with stronger enemies, so you can try the Chapter 1 strategy. [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] is a great option, along with any of the [[Nature's Guardians ELEMENTAL PIXIES (Gacha Event)|Elemental Pixies]] if you happen to have them. If you struggle, get treasures from previous stages.

==='''Chapter 3'''===
The combination of enemies here is terrifying but should not post too much of a threat with proper treasures. Use the strategies stated above, and use cats to crowd control the enemies (especially Freeze). Defeat the Maawth and the LeMurrs and you should win. Hyppoh is not a big threat and acts as a source of money.

